### Secrets ###
# application.properties itself is tracked and must only ever contain
# ${VAR_NAME} placeholders; real values belong in environment variables.
# (Profile-specific files like application-test.properties for test
# fixtures are NOT ignored here since they typically hold no secrets;
# double-check before committing one that it doesn't.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
application-local.properties
application-secrets.properties
*.secrets
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

